721
02:08:11.378 --> 02:08:15.378
There is a congratulatory table and you can also leave that there.

722
02:08:15.378 --> 02:08:17.378
They are just as happy with that.

723
02:08:18.378 --> 02:08:20.378
And then two more things.

724
02:08:20.378 --> 02:08:23.378
The white chairs that are standing behind there...

