02:08:32.378 --> 02:08:34.378
And then we have extra seating again.

730
02:08:34.378 --> 02:08:38.378
So if a few men want to do that, that would be great.

731
02:08:38.378 --> 02:08:39.378
And finally...

732
02:08:39.378 --> 02:08:42.378
Yes, sorry, it's a long list. I can't help it.

733
02:08:42.378 --> 02:08:44.378
Everyone naturally wants something tasty there, right?

734
02:08:44.378 --> 02:08:46.378
Finally, just to be sure.

735
02:08:46.378 --> 02:08:49.378
Tomorrow there will be no praise and worship.

736
02:08:50.378 --> 02:08:51.378
That was it.

737
02:08:51.378 --> 02:08:54.378
Take a moment and enjoy the lunch.
